      "message": "nit: tbh, I don\u0027t fully understand Pierre\u0027 design of `PartialInputs` here, but from the code itself, it looks like that the `PartialInputs` should encompass all the fields that are present in the DICE certificate. This function only takes the current bcc and hidden to deduce the next bcc.\n\nWith the current PS, it also doesn\u0027t look very consistent to have a part of the config in `PartialInputs`, and another part of it as a param of this function.\n\n@ptosi@google.com fyi",
