      "writtenOn": "2024-05-21T11:19:47Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "PartialInput, FWIU, are inputs extracted from verified boot image \u0026 as you mentioned Pierre, the main consumer of it is instance module. Since `instance_hash` has nothing to do with the instance module (that manages instance.img), I would rather not stretch the instance_hash to that instance.rs module.\n\n\u003e PartialInputs should encompass all the fields that are present in the DICE certificate\n\nDon\u0027t think that is possible because of severe tech debt introduced for maintaining flags within the code. We still need salt to be an entry input from instance.img should `cfg!(llpvm_image)` is false.",
      "parentUuid": "1c73b95f_c18cb4fd",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 98,
        "startChar": 8,
        "endLine": 98,
        "endChar": 36
      },
      "revId": "10ece5a4082baad40c13b8b5295354c0607dd79f",
